(7465005, 1184410, 114285, '<td valign="top">One of the most stupidest trends that men and boys have succumbed to. There''s no way we would let our boys dress like that nor did they want to.  This is definitely a pet peeve of mine and my top pick,  as much as I would hate to give this my top mark :-)<br/> <br/>Oh and not to mention also being  glued to that cell phone, and awful tattoo, 3 of my pet peeves.<br/> <br/>Bumping up.</td>', 'One of the most stupidest trends that men and boys have succumbed to. There''s no way we would let our boys dress like that nor did they want to.  This is definitely a pet peeve of mine and my top pick,  as much as I would hate to give this my top mark :-) Oh and not to mention also being  glued to that cell phone, and awful tattoo, 3 of my pet peeves. Bumping up.', '2016-07-19 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7465007, 1184359, 114285, '<td valign="top">Yes incredibly Dorky!!!!!! To the maximums hehe!!</td>', 'Yes incredibly Dorky!!!!!! To the maximums hehe!!', '2016-07-19 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7465008, 1184121, 114285, '<td valign="top">It''s funny when you go out,  that this is the common stance for lots of people they have to have their phone out in their hand looking at it all the time.  A few months ago I was walking the dog, and I saw this guy walk past,  as he was walking towards me I saw him check his phone about four times that was in the space of about 50 yards, he wasn''t really looking at anything, i''m pretty sure it''s just become an obsessive habit that he needs to look at his phone every 20 seconds just in case he misses out on  something. Quite sad really!   <br/> <br/> Not only is this a great angle you took the photo at it''s one of my top peeves, my pick for a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Ps I was going to do something like this but thought this challenge would be full of images like this.</td>', 'It''s funny when you go out,  that this is the common stance for lots of people they have to have their phone out in their hand looking at it all the time.  A few months ago I was walking the dog, and I saw this guy walk past,  as he was walking towards me I saw him check his phone about four times that was in the space of about 50 yards, he wasn''t really looking at anything, i''m pretty sure it''s just become an obsessive habit that he needs to look at his phone every 20 seconds just in case he misses out on  something. Quite sad really!     Not only is this a great angle you took the photo at it''s one of my top peeves, my pick for a ribbon. Ps I was going to do something like this but thought this challenge would be full of images like this.', '2016-07-19 21:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
