(7465071, 1184121, 19825, '<td valign="top">So true and well captured. Love the perspective and high angle of the sun creating the deep dark zombie shadows on the face. And, the cast of background characters is a bonus.</td>', 'So true and well captured. Love the perspective and high angle of the sun creating the deep dark zombie shadows on the face. And, the cast of background characters is a bonus.', '2016-07-20 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7465078, 1184366, 16912, '<td valign="top">I think this is the biggest difference between participants and non participants I''ve ever had, a whopping <b>0.9803</b>, by far the widest spread in the challenge. It was also the third lowest vote given by participants in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I can only gather from this that drip/drop shots are no longer considered the route of all evil here at DPC :) That or ant like drops lol.</td>', 'I think this is the biggest difference between participants and non participants I''ve ever had, a whopping 0.9803, by far the widest spread in the challenge. It was also the third lowest vote given by participants in this challenge. I can only gather from this that drip/drop shots are no longer considered the route of all evil here at DPC :) That or ant like drops lol.', '2016-07-20 11:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
