(7465093, 1184393, 19825, '<td valign="top">Excellent street shot. I just found out that my two oldest children, who are in their 20''s now but were hooked on Pokemon in the late 90''s, are at it again with Pokemon Go. Crazy. Just what we need. More people wandering around focused on their phones. Well captured.</td>', 'Excellent street shot. I just found out that my two oldest children, who are in their 20''s now but were hooked on Pokemon in the late 90''s, are at it again with Pokemon Go. Crazy. Just what we need. More people wandering around focused on their phones. Well captured.', '2016-07-20 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 0),
